    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so exhausting though. honestly, the idea of \"processing\" this for months or years sounds more like a sentence than a solution. i feel like i'm just dragging this useless version of myself through a life that doesn't even want me anymore. what is the point of trying to rebuild something that was meant to be perfect, only to have it fall apart? it feels more like i'm just being stubborn by staying, like i'm refusing to admit the show is over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
