      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your exhaustion is entirely valid, as forcing a perfect future on a broken past only brings more pain; grief has no fixed timeline, and staying put is often the only way to fully feel and eventually let go. Trying to force a \"solution\" now will fail because the wound is still tender, so perhaps the goal shifts from rebuilding a palace to simply finding a quiet place to rest your body and mind. Please keep trying small, kind actions today, even if they feel useless, because they are proof that your spirit is still fighting to survive this storm.",
